# GenSeo landing lane

Landing pages are Shopify **pages** (`/pages/<handle>`), not blog articles: no `daily-tickets.md` entry, no
live-count guard, no tracker row, never in `/blogs/news.atom`, never counted toward the 5 articles/day.
Read `skills/genseo-landing-pages/SKILL.md` and `templates/landing/README.md` in full before touching this lane.

- **Daily lane:** `scripts/build_landing_tickets.py` adds one `- [ ] listicle | <store> | product=<handle> · angle: …`
  line to `daily-landing-tickets.md` (angles in `templates/landing/listicle-angles.json`, LRU product rotation);
  `scripts/run_landing_daily.sh` (launchd 08:15 + 16:15 ICT) builds ONE unpublished `gsl-preview-*` draft per day.
  `landing_guard.py` keeps it to one page/day across both Macs. Kill switch: `state/landing-daily.disabled`.
- **Never auto-live.** Live needs Kevin's explicit GO (`GENSEO_LANDING_LIVE_OK=1 … --live`), refused while
  placeholders remain. A page already live (e.g. `/pages/nmn-after-40-research`) is never hidden or overwritten.
- **Brand files** `brand/<store>.json` carry tokens, voice and `forbidden_terms`; AgeAura allows only
  `ageaura-pure-nmn-tmg-nad-complex`. `validate_landing.py` blocks banned handles and terms.
- **No invented facts:** every number, study, price, rating and review comes from a page fetched this run, else
  `[[PLACEHOLDER: …]]` or cut. Reviews only verbatim from Trustpilot as displayed.
- **Theme:** `--install-template` only adds a missing template key, never overwrites. Any other theme change needs
  `backup_before_changes.py` first — and is never done from a cloud agent.
- Cloud agents may edit angles, specs and templates in the repo and render local previews; publishing a page
  (draft or live) stays on the Macs.
